                  <p>Confinement in prison or psychiatric institution</p>
                </content>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-2">
                  <num>2</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>Subject to subsection (3), the person is taken not to satisfy:</p>
