                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-2__para-b">
                    <num>b</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>paragraph (1A)(d) if, at any time during the 2-year period mentioned in that paragraph;</p>
                    </content>
